Adapted Core files: data.py, helpers.py, sensor.py, validate.py, types.py.
Changes: independent location managers and storage, location-namespaced cost
and transform sensors, explicit manager lookup, task-local validation cost
maps, config-entry sensor setup, durable saves and listener cleanup.
tools/vendor_core.py reproduces the adaptations from retained upstream files.

Native frontend components are loaded from the user's installed Home Assistant.
Generator locations additionally use adapted, namespaced Energy cards and
strategies from Home Assistant Frontend 20261028.4, commit
a67b691a451e0b3fc469679b07158f963a61842c. The build transformations are retained
in tools/build-native.mjs and source hashes in upstream/frontend-extension.json.
Changes add a distinct generator source to accounting, distribution, charts,
tables, Sankeys, gauges, live power and CSV exports without replacing global
Home Assistant definitions. See frontend/native-licenses.txt in the packaged
integration for bundled third-party license notices.

